      "severity": "info",
      "requestIndex": 1,
      "title": "Citation instructions are not counted",
      "detail": "Enabled citations adds provider-side prompt instructions. The local token estimator does not reproduce those instructions, so these totals and costs omit their overhead. Cache scope changes are still respected. A count_tokens calibration request preserves output configuration and citation controls, but one calibration scale cannot reproduce every hidden segment or establish an actual cache hit.",
      "segmentIds": []
    },
