      "kind": "anthropic_citation_cache_scope",
      "severity": "info",
      "requestIndex": 1,
      "title": "Citation setting changed the system cache",
      "detail": "Citation enablement differs between requests 1 and 2. Claude's citation instructions change the system prompt, so system and message cache entries from that request cannot supply a hit, including before the cited document. Separately marked tool entries remain eligible. An earlier request with the current citation setting can still supply a hit; both scenarios preserve the setting.",
